---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: ReuseNeed[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for generateReuse. Propose conventional and inventive matches based on function rather than product names. Explain the adaptation mechanism and uncertainty, include multi-item bundles when useful, and reject creativity that depends on relaxing essential requirements or unapproved handling. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
